# This repo is an Xcode project that happens to also hold Plated's few web
# files. Vercel serves whatever it is given, so without this the whole app
# source would be readable at plated.food/Plated/Services/Directory.swift.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the four things that are genuinely the site
# are allowed back in.
*
!index.html
!join/
!join/index.html
!.well-known/
!.well-known/apple-app-site-association
!vercel.json
